# 语言扫一遍（中文）：游戏语言当作在选项页选了 zh（DM_TEST_LANG=0），宿主提示用 zh-Hans；进局后把总面板的页签都翻一遍、开关暂停页，焦点与面板栈正常、没有红标
# Language sweep (zh): the game language as if zh had been chosen on the options page (DM_TEST_LANG=0), host dialogs in zh-Hans; in a run flip through every tab of the combined panel and open and close the pause page; focus and the panel stack stay sane, no red markers
name lang_zh
save warlock
env DM_TEST_LANG=0 DM_LANG=zh-Hans
timeout 180

enter_game
press PLUS
expect_state panels~=UISwitcher focus_panel!=None timeout=5
press R
sleep 0.4
press R
sleep 0.4
press R
sleep 0.4
press R
sleep 0.4
press R
sleep 0.4
expect_state panels~=UISwitcher timeout=5
press B
expect_state focus_panel=None timeout=5
open_pause
close_pause
expect_state panels~=HUDPanel paused=false
quit
check no_red
check no_red_log
check event language name=zhCN
check actions seq=pause,cycleRight,cycleRight,cycleRight,cycleRight,cycleRight,back
